// GQ has no arithmetic expressions in `match` filters or `return` projections,
// so `age * 2 >= $min`, `age * 2 as twice` and `2026 - age as born_about`
// cannot be written. This returns the raw age instead; the caller computes
// twice = age * 2 and born_about = 2026 - age.
// The caller must also pass $min_age = ceil($min / 2), because age * 2 >= $min
// is equivalent to age >= ceil($min / 2).
query doubled_age($min_age: I32) {
    match {
        $p: Person
        $p.age >= $min_age
    }
    return {
        $p.name,
        $p.age
    }
}
```

